{"3848610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Longed-for Revenge of Undecember", "steam_appid": 3848610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;The Longed-for Revenge of Undecember&gt;</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/015fe11204c4156b9cff20b5290770e5.poster.avif?t=1785499067\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/015fe11204c4156b9cff20b5290770e5.webm?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/015fe11204c4156b9cff20b5290770e5.mp4?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A car plunged into the sea.     <br>Only the driver, who hadn't fastened his seatbelt, survived.     <br>Was it a miracle… or a punishment?   <br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/73dd99759115aeb2da128eb7d2b0ce19.poster.avif?t=1785499067\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/73dd99759115aeb2da128eb7d2b0ce19.webm?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/73dd99759115aeb2da128eb7d2b0ce19.mp4?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Having lost his wife and two children, he could never forgive himself.    <br>Believing that merely staying alive was his sentence, he clung to pills just to get through each day.    <br>But the pills slowly consumed him, dragging him into another world.   <br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/1a2254665f7e42cec7f1ccabc369420d.poster.avif?t=1785499067\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/1a2254665f7e42cec7f1ccabc369420d.webm?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/1a2254665f7e42cec7f1ccabc369420d.mp4?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Twisted memories. Distorted reality.    <br>He can no longer tell dreams from waking life.    <br>An endless nightmare where reality and terror blur together.   <br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/9d03b46e946951ecf113c2b5856a3242.poster.avif?t=1785499067\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/9d03b46e946951ecf113c2b5856a3242.webm?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/9d03b46e946951ecf113c2b5856a3242.mp4?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>But this wasn’t just a tragic accident.    <br>There was a hidden truth. A buried intent.    <br>A story that was never meant to be uncovered.<strong> </strong>   <br><strong> </strong>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/48cc93b1197615726193303b00811d11.poster.avif?t=1785499067\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/48cc93b1197615726193303b00811d11.webm?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/48cc93b1197615726193303b00811d11.mp4?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>    <br> <strong>&lt;The Longed-for Revenge of Undecember&gt; </strong>is a serious horror game based on a true incident that occurred on an island of South Korea. It features a profound theme and a high level of difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/9def452d04c80d52c89e9ce6337b013b.poster.avif?t=1785499067\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/9def452d04c80d52c89e9ce6337b013b.webm?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/9def452d04c80d52c89e9ce6337b013b.mp4?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>        <br>In this game, dreams are used as elements of horror, depicting a state where many memories are merged and distorted, blending the main character’s guilt and fragmented memories into various forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/80263f1db5ded24f8e126fb222a842f9.poster.avif?t=1785499067\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/80263f1db5ded24f8e126fb222a842f9.webm?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/80263f1db5ded24f8e126fb222a842f9.mp4?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>       <br>The game is designed to induce psychological unease through spatial distortion, clairvoyant information, and unique design and sound. We invite you into the <strong>‘Aesthetics of Discomfort’</strong> crafted to match the game’s profound themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/586e9ce45dce2b32b98744adc6bc987a.avif?t=1785499067\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is intended to be horror game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has 2 difficulty levels and 2 different endings. (achievements in game!) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game strives to authentically capture the bizarre atmosphere.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;The Longed-for Revenge of Undecember&gt;</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/015fe11204c4156b9cff20b5290770e5.poster.avif?t=1785499067\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/015fe11204c4156b9cff20b5290770e5.webm?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/015fe11204c4156b9cff20b5290770e5.mp4?t=1785499067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A car plunged into the sea.     <br>Only the driver, who hadn't fastened his seatbelt, survived.     <br>Was it a miracle… or a punishment?   <br>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848610/extras/73dd99759115aeb2da128eb7d2b0ce19.poster.avif?t=1785499067\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/384861